            "title": "Active Pharmaceutical Ingredients (APIs): The Foundation of Modern Medicines | Leading Types, Examples, Supply Chain, and Global Industry FAQ",
            "text": "<p><strong>Active Pharmaceutical Ingredients (APIs)</strong> are the essential chemical, biological, or plant-derived substances in medicines responsible for the intended therapeutic effects. APIs are the backbone of drug formulation, from everyday over-the-counter products like Tylenol to advanced biologics like Ozempic. The global API market is driven by innovation, stringent safety standards, and a robust supply chain that powers both brand-name and generic pharmaceuticals.</p><p><strong>Contact us for API sourcing, custom synthesis, bulk supply, and pharmaceutical manufacturing solutions. Trusted, FDA-compliant, and global logistics for your success!</strong></p>",
